- name: n3_note_tx
  id: note
  parameters:
    note: 'TRANSMITTER: MAC frame -> CRC-32 -> LDPC Encoder (5G NR code, rate 1/2, 2/3, 3/4, 5/6 or uncoded, chosen per frame by

      the link layer) -> CDMA PHY Framer (48 preamble symbols, Golay-coded header, payload as constellation indices) -> one

      lane per Gold code: Chunks to Symbols (BPSK / QPSK / 16-QAM), Repeat x31 and Multiply by the code = spreading -> Burst

      Combiner (adds the lanes, zero-fills) -> RRC pulse shaping -> ANTSDR at 2.5 GHz'
    comment: ''
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate:
